{"id":"cita","lemma":"cita","pos":"noun","rank":515,"glosses":["date (romantic outing)","appointment","quote, quotation"],"ipa":"/ˈθita/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"citas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-cita.wav","formAudio":{"citas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-citas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Tienes cita con él?","en":"Do you have an appointment with him?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534428"},{"text":"Tom habitualmente cumple sus citas.","en":"Tom usually keeps appointments.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804337"},{"text":"La invité a una cita.","en":"I asked her for a date.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460792"},{"text":"Las citas pueden ser muy estresantes.","en":"Dating can be very stressful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582472"},{"text":"Tengo una cita el viernes.","en":"I have a date on Friday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459087"}]}